      03 / WHAT WE WORK TOWARDS
    </span>
    <h2 id="impact-title">
      People first.
      <br/>
      <em>
        Possibility follows.
      </em>
    </h2>
    <p>
      Our work reaches children, young people, women, and families across Silwan and other Jerusalem communities. We also collaborate with institutions and partners beyond Jerusalem.
    </p>
    <ul class="impact-goals">
      <li>
        Stronger learning skills and greater confidence among children.
      </li>
      <li>
        Improved wellbeing and access to supportive relationships.
      </li>
      <li>
        Opportunities for young people to develop talents and leadership skills.
      </li>
      <li>
        Greater participation and practical opportunities for women.
      </li>
      <li>
        Stronger community connections through shared activities and volunteering.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="award">
    <span class="eyebrow">
      RECOGNISED IN 2025
    </span>
